        {
          "moveId": "con-fossils-contingency-unfalsifiability",
          "dimension": "evidenceWarrant",
          "before": {
            "value": 79,
            "rationale": "Fossilization’s rarity and evolutionary contingency are relevant warrants, although empirical examples remain compressed."
          },
          "after": {
            "value": 68,
            "rationale": "Hitchens offers several relevant supports: molecular and fossil records, newly found intermediate forms, Gould's discussion of evolutionary tempo, and a specific Burgess Shale contingency example. These supports are asserted rather than developed in detail, and the audio review expressly does not certify the scientific claims; the contingent survival story also does not by itself warrant the conclusion against guidance."
          },
          "assessmentOrigin": {
